# Widening floating-point dot-product for Spatz
# Ported from the spatz branch (opcodes-rvv). Decoded by Spatz hardware
# (referenced by hw/ip/snitch/src/snitch.sv in the Spatz repo).
# Occupies OP-V funct6=0x3b with funct3=OPFVV/OPFVF; the ratified rv_v
# only uses this funct6 for OPMVV/OPMVX (vwmul.vv/vwmul.vx).

# INFO: overlaps with rv_v (OP-V major opcode 0x57)

vfwdotp.vf     31..26=0x3b vm vs2 rs1 14..12=0x5 vd 6..0=0x57
vfwdotp.vv     31..26=0x3b vm vs2 vs1 14..12=0x1 vd 6..0=0x57
